ui-by-default-search-containers-in-app-bars-use-the-surface-container-color-to-distinguish-it = By default, search containers in app bars use the surface container color to distinguish it from the app background. If the background is darker, use a lighter container color on the search bar, like surface bright.

ui-when-choosing-alternate-colors-make-sure-the-search-text-and-container-have-at-least-3-1-c = When choosing alternate colors, make sure the search text and container have at least 3:1 contrast for readability.

