ui-use-straight-corners-for-app-bars = Use straight corners for app bars

ui-don-t-use-curved-shapes-this-implies-that-the-container-can-expand-upon-interaction = Don't use curved shapes. This implies that the container can expand upon interaction.

ui-always-use-the-default-height-of-the-app-bar-and-make-it-span-the-full-width-of-the-window = Always use the default height of the app bar, and make it span the full width of the window.

