ui-adding-logos = Adding logos

ui-image-logos-can-be-used-in-app-bars-to-bolster-brand-identity-or-visual-appeal-the-image-s = Image logos can be used in app bars to bolster brand identity or visual appeal. The image should be high quality and relevant to the product. It can replace all text in a small app bar, and appears above the text in other variants without disrupting navigation or actions.

ui-a-logo-can-replace-the-headline-in-a-small-app-bar = A logo can replace the headline in a small app bar

