ui-search-label-on-surface-variant = Search label: on surface variant

ui-on-darker-backgrounds-search-bar-containers-can-use-the-surface-bright-role-to-maintain-st = On darker backgrounds, search bar containers can use the surface bright role to maintain strong visual contrast. If mapping to other color roles, make sure the text and container have 3:1 contrast to ensure readability.

ui-make-sure-search-bars-and-their-labels-have-at-least-3-1-contrast-use-the-default-colors-w = Make sure search bars and their labels have at least 3:1 contrast. Use the default colors when possible.

ui-avoid-using-custom-color-roles-for-the-search-bar-container-and-search-label-text-if-custo = Avoid using custom color roles for the search bar container and search label text. If custom roles are necessary, make sure they have contrast of at least 3:1.

